\v 7 [And]{strong=“G1161” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 2”} [he said]{strong=“G2036” x-morph=“robinson: V-2\sc Aai\sc*-3S 1”} [unto]{strong=“G4314” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Prep\sc* 3”} [them]{strong=“G846” x-morph=“robinson: P-\sc Apm\sc* 4”}, \wj It is not for you to know the times or the seasons, which the Father hath put in his own power.\wj* 
\v 8 \wj But ye shall receive power, after that the Holy Ghost is come upon you: and ye shall be witnesses unto me both in Jerusalem, and in all Judæa, and in Samaria, and unto the uttermost part of the earth.\wj* 
